Subject: [PATCH] feat: add /super-admin/migrations UI page

- New page at /super-admin/migrations showing all migrations with
  applied/pending badges, summary stat cards (total/applied/pending),
  and an "Apply N Pending" button that calls POST /api/super-admin/migrations
  and displays per-migration results with duration.

- Sidebar: add Migrations nav item between Announcements and System Health
  using a new 'database' icon.

- Dashboard quick actions: add Migrations card.

- System Health page: label the new 'migrations' check as
  "Schema Migrations" in the checks grid.

- Icon: add 'database' (cylinder / three-layer) SVG path.

